  "sourceTitle": "We built an open-source GPU profiler you point an AI agent at, instead of reading traces yourself",
  "sourceBodyHash": "16dbbc94888d66403ba4ce6e02a3d0f07711cae3f6ec7bdebfd5958977362f83",
